[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-baker-hughes-internship-2026-university-placements-opportunity-130":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},130,"baker-hughes-internship-2026-university-placements-opportunity-130","Baker Hughes Internship 2026: University Placements Opportunity","\u003Cp>Baker Hughes Internship: Are you ready to face the challenges and contribute to technical solutions that shape the future of the energy sector\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>We encourage you to apply for the 2026 Baker Hughes Nigeria Internship and immerse yourself in the dynamic realm of energy technology. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As one of the world’s leading energy technology companies, Baker Hughes offers several internship opportunities across sourcing, engineering, assembly, and maintenance, and invites young graduates to join its organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>You will receive monthly remuneration with a competitive salary, and enjoy health insurance and a lot of other benefits if selected for the internship program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Baker Hughes Internship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Baker Hughes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Health Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Requirements for Baker Hughes Nigeria Internship Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be successful in this role, you must:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be currently enrolled or recently graduated in a Bachelors’ or Masters’ level degree in Engineering, Technology, Mechanics, other STEM-related or business-related program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have maintained a GPA grade greater than or equal to 3.0 out of 4.0 or the equivalent in your country\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be fluent in oral and written English and have effective communication skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be able to legally work in the country that you are applying in, without company sponsorship or time restriction\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Roles and responsibilities for Baker Hughes Undergraduate Internship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp> As an Intern of the Baker Hughes Undergraduate Internship, you will be responsible for:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Completing internal projects to deliver customer outcomes and identify business improvements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Learning internal software to assist with the completion of projects and tasks\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Collaborating with cross-functional teams and interns to interact and network with global business leaders\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applying Health, Safety, and Environment (HS&amp;E) standards and procedures in all situations to ensure compliance is maintained\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Benefits of Baker Hughes Nigeria Internship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As part of the Baker Hughes Undergraduate Internship program, your benefits will include:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly benefits including stipends, lunch meals, and health benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You’ll participate in focused training, and team meetings, work on projects, and present your results.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>During your internship, you will be supported by a buddy and your manager who will ensure you have a valuable learning experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You can expect to receive coaching and mentoring to enable you to complete assignments and projects to develop your learning and skillset.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will also have the opportunity to become familiar with the Health, Safety, and Environment (HS&amp;E) and culture of Baker Hughes. as well as our strong commitment to diversity, equity and inclusion.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.bakerhughes.com\u002Fglobal\u002Fen\u002Fearly-careers-internships\">https:\u002F\u002Fcareers.bakerhughes.com\u002Fglobal\u002Fen\u002Fearly-careers-internships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Ijeoma",16,"published",0,"2026-04-10 16:45:57",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fbaker-hughes-internship-2026-university-placements-opportunity\u002F69d91b35bed328.17293583_screenshot 2026-04-10 164115.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fbaker-hughes-internship-2026-university-placements-opportunity\u002F69d91b35bed328.17293583_screenshot%202026-04-10%20164115.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,